            "text": "<p>Contemporary design meets functional storage in this elegant three-tier display shelf. Featuring clean lines and sophisticated arch-shaped details, this storage unit is perfect for showcasing books, decorative items, and personal collections in any modern home.</p><p><strong>Features</strong><br/>- Three-tier storage shelf with contemporary styling<br/>- Part of our modern home furniture collection<br/>- Three spacious tiers for books and decorative items<br/>- Durable metal construction with premium finishes<br/>- Wide shelving design with elegant arch detailing<br/>- Assembly required</p><p><strong>Care Instructions</strong><br/>- Assembly required - two-person assembly recommended. Instructions and hardware included.<br/>- Metal construction<br/>- Clean with soft, dry cloth<br/>- Quality materials</p><p><strong>Dimensions</strong><br/>- Overall: 27.5\"L x 14\"W x 52.4\"H<br/>- Leg height: 4\"<br/>- Shelf size: 27.5\"L x 14\"W<br/>- Shelf spacing: 15\"<br/>- Weight capacity per shelf: 15 lbs<br/>- Product weight: 26 lbs</p>",
